    "extraction_notes": [
      "Target identity retained exactly from job metadata: CJE3134K, Jiangsu Changjing Electronics Technology Co Ltd, n-channel MOSFET.",
      "The supplied PDF SHA-256 is eb3d938b9ac47612380b41c29e21d1f84b35f8fd256c698d526abb2ad77d002f.",
      "The supplied datasheet footer identifies www.jscj-elec.com and Rev. - 1.0; no more specific revision identifier is stated.",
      "The p. 2 table uses mOhm and pF source units; values are converted to SI units in the output.",
      "RDS(on) table rows are transcribed as inclusive maximum values: 0.38 ohm at VGS = 4.5 V and ID = 0.65 A, 0.45 ohm at VGS = 2.5 V and ID = 0.55 A, and 0.8 ohm at VGS = 1.8 V and ID = 0.45 A; all are pulse-test rows with pulse width <= 300 us and duty cycle <= 0.5%.",
      "The threshold table has MIN = 0.35 V and MAX = 1.1 V; no typical threshold value is printed. The body-diode table provides MAX = 1.2 V at IS = 0.15 A and VGS = 0 V.",
      "Ciss and Crss have no printed test-condition values in the p. 2 table. Their conditions are not inferred; Coss retains the explicitly printed VDS = 16 V, VGS = 0 V, f = 1 MHz condition.",
      "The supplied p. 3 typical plots include output, transfer, on-resistance, body-diode, and threshold characteristics. No capacitance curves are supplied.",
      "Curve points are compact direct readings from the supplied typical plots on p. 3. No points were generated by interpolation between source values."
